---
layout: "layouts/base.njk"
title: "Write for Healthier UK"
description: "Submit a blog to Healthier UK. Your post goes to the editorial team for review before it appears on the site."
permalink: "/contribute.html"
section: "news"
cta: false
---

  <div class="page-header" id="contribute-intro">
    <div class="container container-narrow">
      <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumbs">
        <a href="index.html">Home</a>
        <span class="separator">/</span>
        <a href="blogs.html">Blogs</a>
        <span class="separator">/</span>
        <span class="current">Write for us</span>
      </nav>
      <h1>Write for Healthier UK</h1>
      <p class="lead">Tell us what you are doing to create health where you are. Anyone in the movement can write for us &mdash; you do not need to be a clinician, an academic or a member of anything.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container container-narrow">

      <div class="card mb-5" id="contribute-steps" style="background-color:var(--color-bg-alt); border-left:4px solid var(--color-accent-salmon);">
        <h3>What happens after you submit</h3>
        <ol style="margin:0.75rem 0 0; padding-left:1.35rem; list-style:decimal;">
          <li style="margin-bottom:.4rem;">Your post goes to the Healthier UK editorial team &mdash; it does not appear on the site straight away.</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom:.4rem;">We read it, and may come back to you with small suggestions.</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom:.4rem;">Once approved it is published on the blogs page and on your own page, alongside your organisation.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <form id="contribute-form" class="contribute-form" novalidate>

        <fieldset class="form-block">
          <legend><h2>About you</h2></legend>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="authorName">Your name <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
            <input type="text" id="authorName" name="authorName" required autocomplete="name">
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="authorEmail">Your email <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
            <input type="email" id="authorEmail" name="authorEmail" required autocomplete="email">
            <p class="hint">Only used so we can come back to you about your post. It is never published.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="role">Your role <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
            <input type="text" id="role" name="role" required placeholder="Chief Executive, GP, Community organiser&hellip;">
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="photo">A photo of you</label>
            <input type="file" id="photo" name="photo" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp">
            <p class="hint">A head-and-shoulders photo, JPG or PNG, up to 5MB. Shown on your page and next to your posts.</p>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <fieldset class="form-block">
          <legend><h2>Your organisation</h2></legend>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="org">Organisation name <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
            <input type="text" id="org" name="org" required autocomplete="organization">
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="orgUrl">Organisation website</label>
            <input type="url" id="orgUrl" name="orgUrl" placeholder="https://">
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="orgDescription">About your organisation</label>
            <textarea id="orgDescription" name="orgDescription" rows="7" maxlength="2200"
                      data-wordlimit="250"
                      placeholder="Up to 250 words, in your own words. This appears on your page when someone clicks your name."></textarea>
            <p class="hint"><span class="wordcount" data-for="orgDescription">0</span> of 250 words</p>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <fieldset class="form-block">
          <legend><h2>Your blog</h2></legend>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="title">Title <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
            <input type="text" id="title" name="title" required maxlength="120">
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="summary">One-line summary <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
            <input type="text" id="summary" name="summary" required maxlength="200">
            <p class="hint">Shown on the blogs page under the title. One or two sentences.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="lead">Opening paragraph <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
            <textarea id="lead" name="lead" rows="3" required maxlength="500"></textarea>
            <p class="hint">The standfirst, shown large at the top of your article.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="body">The post <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
            <textarea id="body" name="body" rows="16" required
                      placeholder="Write as you would in an email. Leave a blank line between paragraphs."></textarea>
            <p class="hint"><span class="wordcount" data-for="body">0</span> words. Around 600&ndash;900 works well.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="image">A picture to go with it</label>
            <input type="file" id="image" name="image" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp">
            <p class="hint">Optional. JPG or PNG, up to 5MB. Please only send pictures you have permission to use.</p>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <div class="field field-check">
          <input type="checkbox" id="consent" name="consent" required>
          <label for="consent">I am happy for Healthier UK to publish this post, my name, role, photo and organisation on the website. <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
        </div>

        <div id="turnstile-holder" data-sitekey=""></div>

        <p class="form-error" id="form-error" role="alert" hidden></p>

        <div class="btn-group" style="margin-top:1.5rem;">
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" id="submit-btn">Send for review</button>
          <a href="blogs.html" class="btn btn-outline btn-lg">Back to blogs</a>
        </div>
      </form>

      <div id="contribute-success" class="card" hidden
           style="text-align:center; padding:3.5rem 2rem; background-color:var(--color-bg-alt);">
        <h2 style="margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Thank you</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--hu-text-muted); max-width:46ch; margin:0 auto 1.75rem;">
          Your post has gone to the Healthier UK editorial team. We will be in touch at the email
          address you gave us. Nothing appears on the site until it has been reviewed.
        </p>
        <a href="blogs.html" class="btn btn-accent">Back to blogs</a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
